[283.699909, "o", "\u001b[?25l\u001b[H\u001b[K\u001b[1m\r\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1m\r\n  Kueue Preemption Demo: Priority Scheduling on GPU Fleet   \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[1m\r\n══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  This demo shows three levels of GPU workload priority:\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[35m1.\u001b[39m Low-priority experiments fill available GPU capacity\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[36m2.\u001b[39m Inference HPA scales up under load, evicting experiments\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[31m3.\u001b[39m Critical pre-training job preempts even inference servers\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mClusters: us-east1 (8 GPUs) + us-west3 (8 GPUs) = 16 GPUs total\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[36m\r\n▸ Initial GPU state\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1meast1\u001b(B\u001b[m  [\u001b[36m██\u001b[39m░░░░░░]  \u001b[36m2i\u001b[39m \u001b[35m0t\u001b[39m \u001b[2m6 free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[1mwest3\u001b(B\u001b[m  [\u001b[36m██\u001b[39m░░░░░░]  \u001b[36m2i\u001b[39m \u001b[35m0t\u001b[39m \u001b[2m6 free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mLegend: \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[36m█\u001b[39m\u001b[2m=inference \u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[35m█\u001b[39m\u001b[2m=training ░=free\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n  ↵ Press Enter to continue...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[36m\r\n▸ Step 1a: Submitting pre-training job (6 replicas x 1 GPU, 10min duration)\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mPriority: training-critical (2000) — will hold GPUs through the demo\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\njobset.jobset.x-k8s.io/pre-training-1 created\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[32m✓\u001b[39m pre-training-1 submitted to east1\u001b[K\u001b[2m\r\n  ↵ Press Enter to continue...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n^C\u001b[K\u001b[33m\r\nInterrupted — running cleanup...\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[33m\r\nCleaning up...\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mDeleting load generator pods...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mDeleting experiment and pre-training jobs...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\nNo resources found\u001b[K\r\nNo resources found\u001b[K\r\njobset.jobset.x-k8s.io \"pre-training-1\" deleted from training-jobs namespace\u001b[K\r\n  \u001b[2mResetting HPAs to min=2, max=6...\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[K\r\nhorizontalpodautoscaler.autoscaling/vllm-inference-hpa configured\u001b[K\r\nhorizontalpodautoscaler.autoscaling/vllm-inference-hpa configured\u001b[K\r\ndeployment.apps/vllm-llama3-8b-instruct scaled\u001b[K\r\ndeployment.apps/vllm-llama3-8b-instruct scaled\u001b[K\u001b[32m\r\nCleanup complete.\u001b[39m\u001b[K\r\nnickeberts@vllm-blackwell-builder:~/blackwell-vllm$ ^C\u001b[K\r\nnickeberts@vllm-blackwell-builder:~/blackwell-vllm$ ^C\u001b[K\r\nnickeberts@vllm-blackwell-builder:~/blackwell-vllm$ ^C\u001b[K\r\nnickeberts@vllm-blackwell-builder:~/blackwell-vllm$ ^C\u001b[K\r\nnickeberts@vllm-blackwell-builder:~/blackwell-vllm$ \u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\r\n\u001b[K\u001b[30m\u001b[42m\r\n[demo-reco0:bash*                                                                                                                                                                     \"vllm-blackwell-builde\" 17:45 21-Apr-26\u001b(B\u001b[m\u001b[?12l\u001b[?25h\u001b[49;53H\u001b[?2004h"]
